      "widgets_values": [
        "OFFICIAL H3 / SPEED\n\nThis is the editable graph used by the API. Save back to h3_presets/speed.json in ComfyUI's workflow folder to change future renders.\n\nModel, attention, sampler, schedule, refinement and De-rope settings live in these nodes. No all-in-one node.\n\nMusic Suite / H3 Lab still supply prompt, size, frames, seed, references, guides and final audio. Node properties mark those request bindings.\n\nManual use: fill the prompt. Optional reference is muted; choose an image and unmute it. Frame-guide node is bypassed; choose its image and enable it. API requests insert their own media nodes."
      ],
